      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>A property marked as bound, will notify it's value change to registered listeners.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
    </ownedComment>
