      <body>&lt;HTML>&lt;HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;META content=&quot;MSHTML 6.00.2900.3199&quot; name=GENERATOR>&lt;/HEAD>&#xD;
&lt;BODY>A property marked as constrained sends a veto event to registered listener before changing it's value. The veto listener may refuse the change.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
