&lt;BODY>A property or association marked as &lt;STRONG>&amp;lt;&amp;lt;Temporal&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/STRONG> defines the existence of a time variance of the value.&lt;/BODY>&lt;/HTML></body>
    </ownedComment>
